id: vehicle-boost-speed
name: Boost Speed
kind: vehicle quality
slots: 1
source: Vehicles
boostedSpeed: doubleOutput
# Its entry as the Vehicles page prints it, word for word.
text: >
  Boost Speed: This Vehicle is equipped with speed boosters of some kind, allowing it to go even faster.
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –Quality Slots: 1
  –Effects: This Vehicle's Boosted Speed is instead equal to double its Output. You may use the Rapid Movement option
  of the Movement Maneuver while Piloting this Vehicle.

